<title>SINGAPORE: UIS 1996 net profit up 2.2 pct.</title>
<headline>UIS 1996 net profit up 2.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    7.70  vs   7.53</p>
